# lychee link-check ignore patterns

# Internal anchor links — lychee does not always resolve in-page anchors
# correctly across mixed-language headers; markdown linter handles these
^#

# Localhost and example domains used in code samples
localhost
127\.0\.0\.1
example\.com
example\.org

# OAuth / login-required URLs
discord\.com/oauth
github\.com/.+/oauth

# Internal NDA-bound platform portals (intentionally unreachable externally)
partner\.steamgames\.com/doc
developer\.playstation\.com
partner\.microsoft\.com/dashboard

# Common rate-limited or geo-fenced sources
fonts\.adobe\.com
adobe\.com/products/aftereffects
